          "id": "f4373d16-bc57-46a9-95bb-3847dafd2834",
          "name": "Token",
          "request": {
            "name": "Token",
            "description": {
              "content": "Exchanges an external identity provider token for a Pulumi access token using the OAuth 2.0 Token Exchange flow (RFC 8693).\n\nThe request body must include:\n- `audience`: a URN identifying the target org (e.g., `urn:pulumi:org:{ORG_NAME}`)\n- `grant_type`: must be `urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:token-exchange`\n- `subject_token`: the OIDC identity token from the external provider\n- `subject_token_type`: must be `urn:ietf:params:oauth:token-type:id_token`\n- `requested_token_type`: one of `urn:pulumi:token-type:access_token:organization`, `...team`, `...personal`, or `...runner`\n\nOptional parameters:\n- `scope`: depends on the requested token type. For `organization`, must be empty or `admin`. For `team`, must be `team:TEAM_NAME`. For `personal`, must be `user:USER_LOGIN`. For `runner`, must be `runner:RUNNER_NAME`.\n- `expiration`: token lifetime in seconds\n\nThe response includes `access_token`, `issued_token_type`, `token_type`, `expires_in`, `scope`, and `refresh_token`.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "api",
                "oauth",
                "token"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
